    ('865dcc6d-fa4c-429b-8c16-908cb96dcec2'::uuid, 'card_description', 'No one knows when Tarragona was first founded. The Scipio brothers turned it into a fortress and arsenal against the Carthaginians; Mela called it the richest town on the coast.', NULL, 'teaser-card-s033-rollback:865dcc6d-fa4c-429b-8c16-908cb96dcec2:card_description', 'rollback of teaser-card-s033: card_description None restored on Tarragona', '43ae59685cca5d9b35592d9961a05167df590a169ec200e2c7ed5fdc428a1b0d|9854eead7b248e8c8543397238f7d99e9e16a3b049f62337485d5bb1071298a4|9854eead7b248e8c8543397238f7d99e9e16a3b049f62337485d5bb1071298a4', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-cardgap-2026-10-07: writer teaser-write-010", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-cardgap-2026-10-07/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "No one knows when Tarragona was first founded. The Scipio brothers turned it into a fortress and arsenal against the Carthaginians; Mela called it the richest town on the coast."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-cardgap-2026-10-07: checker teaser-check-010 (check), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-cardgap-2026-10-07/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "when Tarragona was first founded is unknown [S1]; the Scipio brothers converted it into a fortress and arsenal against the Carthaginians [S2]; according to Mela it was the richest town on the coast [S5]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-cardgap-2026-10-07: verifier teaser-verify-030 (verify), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-cardgap-2026-10-07/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Tarragona is a city and municipality in Catalonia, Spain [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tarragona]; The real founding date of Tarragona is unknown [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tarragona]; Tarragona''s origins trace back to a possible Iberian settlement (Kesse/Kosse) and the exact connection remains uncertain [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tarragona]; The brothers Publius Cornelius Scipio and Gnaeus Cornelius Scipio Calvus fortified and 